}}
* {{Drink|name=Line Brew|address=Kenesary Street 20|lat=51.163666502890955|long=71.41610156968173|lastedit=2025-10-26|content=Line Brew is a relatively well-known beer brand across the city. Primarily a restaurant during the day, though as the evening turns to night it becomes more bar than steak house. Quite expensive and a reservation is recommended on Friday/Saturday nights.}}
* {{Drink|name=Winners Pub|address=Dinmukhamed Qonayev St 35|lat=51.130059685337635|long=71.43730327503086|lastedit=2025-10-26|content="Hidden gem" of a bar within spitting distance of Baiterek Tower. Very reasonably priced considering its prime location. Also offers Shisha and Karaoke.}}
* {{Drink|name=Harat's Irish Pub|address=Zheltoqsan St 2Т|lat=51.16259899941295|long=71.41950300106893|lastedit=2025-10-26|content=Astana's Irish-style pub. Quite popular among expats, although the crowd still overwhelmingly skews local as there are not that many expats in Astana. Not the cheapest place in the city, but has live music a lot of nights and usually has a good crowd later in the evening. The block near Harat's has a lot of bars close to the river and is generally a good place to find yourself in the summer when you have a thirst.}}
