*{{Drink|name=Bla Bla Bar|address=Syganak St 60/5|lastedit=2025-10-26|content=Astana's premier nightclub, located in Abu Dhabi Plaza. Expect long lines on Friday and Saturday night. Face control is enforced and there are stricter age restrictions for men, though foreigners seem exempt from this.}}

